{"id":"n71695-1-8","stage":3,"title":"인상 · 相貌","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71695-1-8-1","ko":"승규는 얼굴이 참 사납게 생겼어.","zh":"承奎的长相看起来真凶狠啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"容貌","explanation":"얼굴：容貌；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사납게","meaning":"凶，恶狠狠","explanation":"사납다：凶，恶狠狠；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"사납다","audio":"/audio/b7df06cd769f595a2dc2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62173","senseId":"2","lemma":"사납다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생겼어.","meaning":"长","explanation":"생기다：长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"4","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"容貌","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"头部前面部分的整体长相或样子。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"b7df06cd769f595a","term":"사납다","zh":"凶，恶狠狠","audio":"/audio/b7df06cd769f595a2dc2.mp3","entryId":"62173","definition":"长相可怕凶狠。","pronunciation":["사ː납따"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"人或事物的长相成为某种样子。","pronunciation":["생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3960216a0b3de918c272.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71695-1-8-2","ko":"맞아. 좀 험한 인상이긴 하지.","zh":"对，给人的印象确实有点吓人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"험한","meaning":"凶狠，粗鲁","explanation":"험하다：凶狠，粗鲁；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"험하다","audio":"/audio/50129992a01c556eebfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86842","senseId":"2","lemma":"험하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인상이긴","meaning":"相貌，面相","explanation":"인상：相貌，面相；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"인상","audio":"/audio/27fde7b1960b21e89a36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71695","senseId":"1","lemma":"인상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지.","meaning":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"正是或没错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"50129992a01c556e","term":"험하다","zh":"凶狠，粗鲁","audio":"/audio/50129992a01c556eebfa.mp3","entryId":"86842","definition":"长相、样子等粗犷，使人厌恶。","pronunciation":["험ː하다"]}